      "why_it_matters": "Strategic shift",
      "summary": "The Anthropic study suggests that AI is redefining the nature of expertise by separating knowledge from the ability to effectively communicate and transmit that knowledge. As a result, success in AI-assisted work increasingly depends on one's capacity to construct and articulate clear models for AI to act upon, rather than solely on domain expertise.",
